{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-0r.ancient": "又一個從別的故事里走出來的家伙。你是誰？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.char": "巡邏騎士。月圓之夜還沒結束，城鎮還等著我回去。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-1r.next": "繼續",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.0-2r.ancient": "那就回去吧，小紅帽。別讓狼等太久。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.ancient": "又是你。你的外婆還好嗎？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.char": "她讓我捎句話：別擋路。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-1r.next": "繼續",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.1-2r.ancient": "……好一個外婆。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.ancient": "你的誓言，比這座塔還要頑固。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.char": "以月光起誓——我從不食言。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-1r.next": "繼續",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.FULLMOONKNIGHT-KNIGHT.2-2r.ancient": "那就看看，月光能照到多高。"
}
